{"abstract":"I investigate 17 mathematics student teachers’ productions, in view of examining the synergy and interaction between their mathematical and didactical knowledge. The concrete data material consists in lesson plans elaborated for the final exam of a unit on “numbers, arithmetic and algebra”. The anthropological theory of the didactic is used as a framework to analyse these components of practical and theoretical knowledge.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Carlsen, Louise Meier"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-513881"],"event":{"acronym":"CERME","end":"2015-02-08","place":"Prag, cz","start":"2015-02-04","title":"Ninth Congress of the European Society for Research in Mathematics Education","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"analysing student teachers lesson plans mathematical and didactical organisations","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-513881","ids":["ku-c9aa14a8-90a8-4977-b755-c9a11c953396"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D9AF3802FCCD540B83818408C1CD168A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Science Education, Didactics of Mathematics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Louise Meier","key":"carlsenpau","last":"Carlsen","locid":"70d1b2b6-b2e7-4425-ab76-862494ce5c48","name":"Carlsen, Louise Meier","orcid":"0000-0003-3987-9350","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Konrad","key":"krainerpedh","last":"Krainer","name":"Krainer, Konrad","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Nadia","key":"vondrovápedh","last":"Vondrová","name":"Vondrová, Nadia","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9788072908448"],"pages":"2949-2950","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the Ninth Congress of the European Society for Research in Mathematics Education"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-c9aa14a8-90a8-4977-b755-c9a11c953396"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Analysing student teachers’ lesson plans : Mathematical and didactical organisations","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-513881","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
